 assets/posts/fanuc.cps            |  32 +++++-
 crates/post/tests/fanuc_aicc.rs   | 166 ++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++
 docs/decisions/2603-fanuc-aicc.md |  49 +++++++++
 3 files changed, 245 insertions(+), 2 deletions(-)
